# Relay docs redirect map.
# Format: <source-path> <dest-path> [<status>]
# Compatible with Netlify / Cloudflare Pages syntax.
# GitHub Pages does NOT natively read _redirects -- but this file is the
# canonical source-of-truth for when relay.epochly.com migrates to a CDN
# that does (Cloudflare Pages, Netlify).
#
# Goal: SDK-emitted URLs like https://relay.epochly.com/docs/errors/RELAY-*
# resolve to the generated pages at /reference/errors/RELAY-*/index.html.

/docs/errors/*   /reference/errors/:splat/index.html   301
/errors/*        /reference/errors/:splat/index.html   301
